# =============================================================================
# InsureFlow — line-ending policy.
#
# Files executed INSIDE Linux containers (shell init scripts, SQL piped through
# psql, healthcheck helpers) must use LF. CRLF authored on Windows breaks
# /bin/sh and psql here-docs in the container — see procedures/docker-healthcheck.md.
# =============================================================================
*.sh   text eol=lf
*.sql  text eol=lf
*.conf text eol=lf
